#
# Schema definitions roughly equivalent to the schema which
# /usr/lib/ldap/idsconfig will add to an iPlanet Directory Server.
# With these definitions included in slapd.conf, openldap can act as an
# LDAP server for openindiana systems using the native ldap name service
# switch module.
#

