attributeType ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.42.2.27.5.1.2 NAME 'SolarisProjectName' EQUALITY caseExactIA5Match SYNTAX 1.3.6.1.4.1.1466.115.121.1.26 SINGLE-VALUE )
